{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04890","headline":"闰九月九日幸总持寺登浮图应制 · 李乂","name":"闰九月九日幸总持寺登浮图应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"清跸幸禅楼，前驱历御沟。\n还疑九日豫，更想六年游。\n圣藻辉缨络，仙花缀冕旒。\n所欣延亿载，宁祗庆重秋。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李乂","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04890.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04890","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}